<title>SWEDEN: Assa Abloy shares jump on Vachette buy.</title>
<headline>Assa Abloy shares jump on Vachette buy.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Swedish lockmaker Assa Abloy jumped 16 crowns to 167 when trading resumed on Wednesday after the company announced it was buying French lockmaker Vachette for 1.1 billion francs.</p>
<p>The Stockhom bourse had suspended trading before the market opened on Wednesday pending the announcment.  </p>
<p>By 1000 GMT, the share price had risen further, to 174 crowns, a 23-crown rise on the day. -- Simon Haydon, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1004</p>
</text>
